# --- Secrets / credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*secret*
*credentials*
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.token
apify_token*
.secrets/
config/local*.yaml
config/*secret*

# --- Phase briefs and agent-only notes ---
phases/
handoff.md
**/handoff.md
review.md
**/review.md
docs/HOME_RESUME.md
docs/SPEED.md
scripts/_*.py
scripts/27_balanced_efficient_scrape.py
